The wheel's METADATA declares License-Expression: MIT AND Apache-2.0 AND OFL-1.1.

The wheel's NOTICE refers to third_party/usd-brep/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md,
which the wheel does not include. usd-brep-THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md is that file
reproduced verbatim from the USD BRep repository, fetched on 2026-10-18 from:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NVIDIA-Omniverse/usd-brep/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

usd-brep-THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md SHA-256:
9fcacebdd1d3e2559959cc504331b0f58d3b3f460b9da5caea4efc84fd20eb7b

The wheel does not name the USD BRep commit it compiles, so this copy is the
repository's current notice file rather than one tied to a tag. The compiled
extension (smlibpy/_core) links only the C and C++ runtime of the host and
embeds pybind11 (BSD 3-Clause), whose notice is in that file.
